      "writtenOn": "2021-04-19T20:12:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Interesting, so this is a delay between releasing of reset and the stm32mon doing stuff?\n\nOur board has a 10k pullup on this line, so I guess it\u0027s marginal/not fast enough?\n\nI would feel a lot better with this number if we had scope shots of this event (reset releasing vs cs asserting), together with perhaps a datasheet of the stm32 bootloader guide saying what the earliest time it\u0027s ready to accept commands is.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 301,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 301,
        "endChar": 10
      },
      "revId": "2adb69157df6ca3d3a393751858709a66e842a17",
