        "id": 1413538
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-20T22:05:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I couldn\u0027t get the scope shots for this event. I guess, we need to consider rise time with the pull up. Having 10K pull resistor and 0.1 uF capacitor, the rise time comes around to be 0.8473 ms. Issue fixes with delay of 1 ms. Surprisingly, even adding \u0027sleep 0\u0027 works and I guess system call overhead may provide enough delay by itself.",
